# SMARTPYME — COMPLETE MASTER PROMPT
## Full Business Management SaaS Platform | Design, Features, Logic & System Architecture

### 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a complete, functional, modern SaaS web application called **SmartPyme**.

**Brand tagline:** “Tu negocio, bajo control.”

SmartPyme is an all-in-one business management platform designed to help small businesses organize their daily operations, monitor sales, control inventory, calculate product costs, understand profitability, and make better business decisions through artificial intelligence.

The initial target market is small cafés, coffee shops, restaurants, and food businesses in Panama. However, the architecture must allow the platform to expand to other types of small businesses in the future.

This must be a real, functional application, not merely a visual prototype. All buttons, forms, tables, filters, calculations, dashboards, navigation elements, and system interactions must work.

**Project constraints:**
- Initial development budget: B/.0.
- Prefer no-code or low-code technologies.
- No custom programming should be required for the initial implementation whenever possible.
- The application must be scalable and easy to maintain.
- The interface must be in Spanish.
- Currency: USD (B/.).
- Time zone: America/Panama.
- Date format: DD/MM/YYYY.

